  "markdown": "[Skip to main content](https://avispl.com/services/managed-services/#main-content)\n\n# Managed  Services\n\nLet Our Experts Manage Your Collaboration Technology\n\nScroll to bottom of the hero section\n\n![managed services team member with collaboration technology](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/03-26-2023_SkyCenter_0970-1-scaled.webp)\n\n### Certified technicians support and manage technology\n\nSave time and let your staff focus on strategic initiatives. Our team will manage your audio visual and unified communications ecosystem for you.\n\n[Contact Us](https://avispl.com/services/managed-services/#contact)\n\n## ChooseYour  SupportLevel\n\n[Contact Us](https://avispl.com/services/managed-services/#contact)\n\n- ###### Managed Services\n\n\n\n\nLeverage AVI-SPL’s experience, engineering expertise, and solutions architects to design and plan your collaboration technology solutions and infrastructure. We provide discovery, assessment, and roadmap development.\n\n\n\n[Contact Us](https://avispl.com/services/managed-services/#contact)\n\n- ###### Enterprise Managed Services\n\n\n\n\nEnterprise Managed Services cover audio-visual (AV), digital signage, and unified communications (UC) technology. We manage technology throughout your modern workplace and public spaces, in rooms, and in the cloud.\n\n\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/services/enterprise-managed-services/)\n\n- ###### Onsite Managed Services\n\n\n\n\nNeed someone onsite to help manage your tech on site every day? AVI-SPL can provide dedicated technicians on call up to twenty-four hours a day, seven days a week.\n\n\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/services/onsite-managed-services/)\n\n- ###### Asset Inventory Services\n\n\n\n\nAsset Inventory Services (AIS) is a subscription service that provides lifecycle tracking of your AV and UC physical assets, furniture, consumables, and contractual assets. Help IT improve efficiency, reduce risk, and enhance the user experience.\n\n\n\n[Explore](https://avispl.com/services/asset-inventory-services/)\n\n\n### Give IT Teams the    Support They Need\n\nOur Other services\n\n### Keepingyourteamand  yourbusinessconnected\n\n[Contact](https://avispl.com/services/managed-services/#contact)\n\n[![A woman at a desk joins a video call on a laptop with four smiling people, holding a pen and notebook by charts and papers.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Voice-cloud-calling-Img-v2-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Collaboration as a Service**](https://avispl.com/services/collaboration-as-a-service/) [![A technician in a black shirt examines cables by server racks in a tech-filled room with a tiled ceiling, creating an industrial vibe.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Support-and-Maintenance-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Global Deployment**](https://avispl.com/services/global-deployment/) [![Lecture hall with rows of chairs, tables facing screens showing AVI-SPL logo; overhead lights, exit signs visible.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Rose-State-Colleges-Tanenbaum-Aerospace-and-Cybersecurity-Center-tiered-lecture-hall-with-Epson-projectors-on-1024x594.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Professional Services**](https://avispl.com/services/professional-services/)\n\n12\n\n### Case Studies\n\nSee how we elevate events and environments through tailored audio-visual solutions.\n\n[View All](https://avispl.com/resources/case-studies/)\n\n[![Night view: modern building with striking blue exterior lighting. Person approaches glass entrance; interior brightly lit.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/museum-blue.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\nCase Study\\\\\n\\\\\n**Canada Science and Technology Museum** View more](https://avispl.com/resources/case-studies/canada-science-and-technology-museum/) [![A person in a purple shirt and red tie sits on a bench using a laptop in a modern indoor space with glass walls and stairs.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RMIT_1100x640.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\nCase Study\\\\\n\\\\\n**RMIT University Symphony Case Study** View more](https://avispl.com/resources/case-studies/rmit-symphony-av-uc-systems-management/) [![Modern council chamber: U-shaped desks, chairs, flags in corner, AVI-SPL on screen; well-lit, neutral tones, carpeted floor.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/20240607_143337-scaled-2-scaled.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\nCase Study\\\\\n\\\\\n**City of North Battleford** View more](https://avispl.com/resources/case-studies/city-of-north-battleford/)\n\n13\n\n### Partners\n\nWe partner with leading collaboration providers.\n\n[![cisco logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cisco-seeklogo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Creston-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/)[![Google logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/google-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/google/)[![HP Poly logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hp-poly-large.svg)](https://avispl.com/hp-poly/)[![Logitech Logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/logitech-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/logitech/)[![Microsoft logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/microsoft-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/microsoft/)[![Neat logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Neat-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/neat/)[![Q-SYS logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/q-sys.svg)](https://avispl.com/q-sys/)[![Sennheiser logo: stylized S icon on the left, followed by bold SENNHEISER in capitals. Simple black and white design.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Sennheiser-Logo.png)](https://avispl.com/sennheiser/)[![zoom-logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/zoom-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/zoom/)\n\n[![cisco logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cisco-seeklogo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Creston-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/